@shipmentDeleteId = a6f3c0e0-0001-4000-8000-000000000005

### Event action:delete — removes the local replica row by source key (ID).
### OData management execute does not carry the nested event object in v1;
### this demo action wraps executeEvent for the HTTP scenario.
POST http://localhost:4107/odata/v4/example/runEventDelete
Content-Type: application/json

{"id": "{{shipmentDeleteId}}"}

###
GET http://localhost:4107/odata/v4/example/Shipments?$filter=id eq {{shipmentDeleteId}}

### Remote row still exists on the provider.
GET http://localhost:4455/odata/v4/logistics/Shipments({{shipmentDeleteId}})

### Batch full refresh restores the local copy.
POST http://localhost:4107/pipeline/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Shipments","mode":"full","trigger":"manual"}

###
GET http://localhost:4107/odata/v4/example/Shipments?$filter=id eq {{shipmentDeleteId}}
